  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-03",
  "title": "同時走失",
  "storyCode": "6-3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "23916efc2fead66ea7572555bdacc222989efd8d3dfc433018deadbdcbad4991",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（后）\n有多少人死在你面前了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "（烏薩斯語）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "我會的。我會帶回去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "......（烏薩斯語）......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "嗯。我不去切爾諾伯格。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "放心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "這裡很安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "睡吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "有多少人死在我面前了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "放下武器！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......只有你一個？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "別回頭。再動一下，我就射擊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "弩手要先射擊，再說話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "什麼？身體......消失了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "不......情報檔案上有，你是他們的指揮官之一，浮士德。你的法術瞞不住我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "我知道，我知道你的法術只對視覺起作用。只要我射擊，你也一樣會被弩箭刺穿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "不會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你能預判我的動作？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "我們，兩個落單的弩手。同時按下扳機，我們都死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你的名字？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "代號灰喉。你什麼時候跳到我身後的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你第三次眨眼的時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......你很爽快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "你也和你的小隊失散了。我不想殺傷沒有戰意的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "我們是敵人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "羅德島想要救助感染者。我看到你在幫助感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......那是我的戰友。你是我的敵人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "羅德島怎麼會有這樣幼稚的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "是的，我很幼稚。我只會按命令做事。當我自己做決定時，我什麼都做不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你要當心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "手指鬆開！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "你的弩沒有連射機能。只要我躲過你的第一發射擊，你就會死。別去按扳機。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "只聽從命令，一味依賴別人的想法行動，最後會變成可怕的模樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "多數人只是盲從，他們會退縮，也會顫抖。他們並不真依賴誰，他們只是沒有開始思考。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......而那些沒有自己方向的人，只是種索求願望來獲得成就感和存在感的機器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "啟動，不斷運作，投入願望，實現願望，把周圍一切都吃掉，把許願的人也吃掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "我不會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你經歷的還不夠多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "我看見你和剛才那個感染者最後的對話。你在做對的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你的對錯和我無關。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "浮士德，你一直在避開近衛局，哪怕是落單的龍門近衛局，你也沒有射擊他們。這些我都看到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......別把我的忍耐當成軟弱。如果伏擊的人是我，你已經死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "但你沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "你很累了。只要是用弩的人，都能看出你的疲勞。弦繃得太緊，這樣下去一定會斷掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......作為弩手，你實在太多話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "你也遭遇了那些特殊感染者，我們可以想辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你說的也許很對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "等等！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "但我沒有辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "（在開始運動的一瞬間消失了？......沒法判斷他的位置！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "為什麼不殺我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你沒有射擊我，我也沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "下次不會了。如果你沒射殺我，我就會射殺你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "我沒有惡意！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "那才最可憐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......也許你需要別人回答你的問題。不回答，你就不懂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "別有負擔，殺人、被殺，這種事天天發生。你們羅德島也不可能避過的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......為什麼不能一起幫助他們？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "——我很想答應你的要求，但我知道不可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "別再追蹤我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你和他們的接觸太少了，大腦裡滿是錯覺和誤解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......而我已經，沒有任何辦法了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "有多少人因為我做了什麼而死，又有多少人因為我什麼都沒做而死？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
